# MyEnv Clink Readline Configuration
# Standard Text Cursor Movement + History Search + Tab File Completion

# 1. Standard Left & Right Arrows for Editing Text & Correcting Typos:
# (Left and Right arrows move cursor character-by-character natively)

# 2. Up & Down Arrows (↑ / ↓) -> Search Actual Command History matching typed prefix
"\e[A": history-search-backward
"\e[B": history-search-forward

# 3. Tab Key -> File, Directory & Path Completion Menu
"\t": clink-completion-popup

# 4. Ctrl+Space / F7 / Ctrl+R -> Interactive Command History Popup List
"\C-@": clink-popup-history
"Control-space": clink-popup-history
"\C-r": clink-popup-history
